    "text": "Next morning Willoughby {RETURNS} her letters, and the {LOCK} of her hair, with a cold note: he is to marry a Miss Grey, with fifty {THOUSAND} pounds. Marianne is {HEARTBROKEN}. Kind Mrs. Jennings brings every cure she knows: sweetmeats, {OLIVES}, and a glass of fine old {WINE}.",
